flowchart LR
  Admin[Admin] --> Open[Open gallery]
  Open --> Auth[Next.js authenticates Admin]
  Auth --> Scope{Role and gallery scope valid?}
  Scope -- No --> Deny[Reject and audit]
  Scope -- Yes --> Select[Select JPEG photos]

  Select --> Session[Next.js creates/resumes owner upload session]
  Session --> Owner{Creating Admin owns session?}
  Owner -- No --> SessionDeny[Reject resume/cancel]
  Owner -- Yes --> Sign[Generate 15-minute signed R2 authorization]
  Sign --> Browser[Browser uploads directly]
  Browser --> Mode{File size}
  Mode -- Up to 10 MB --> Single[Single upload]
  Mode -- Over 10 MB --> Multi[Multipart upload: 8 MB parts]
  Multi --> PartRetry[Retry failed parts independently]
  PartRetry --> Complete[Browser signals completion]
  Single --> Complete

  Complete --> Verify[Next.js verifies R2 object, size, SHA-256, valid JPEG]
  Verify -- Invalid/incomplete --> Reject[Reject upload]
  Reject --> Cleanup[Track and retry object/multipart cleanup]
  Verify -- Valid --> Record[Record verified photo in PostgreSQL]
  Record --> Queue[Enqueue BullMQ job in Upstash Redis]
  Queue --> Worker[Separate photo worker]
  Worker --> Read[R2: read unchanged original]
  Read --> Sharp[Sharp derivative processing]
  Sharp --> Outputs[Download JPEG q92<br/>Gallery WebP max 2000px q80<br/>Thumbnail WebP max 500px 4:3 crop q65]
  Outputs --> Status[Update independent derivative statuses in PostgreSQL]
  Status --> ProcessRetry{Processing failure?}
  ProcessRetry -- Yes --> Retry[Up to 3 automatic attempts<br/>or manual Admin retry]
  Retry --> Queue
  ProcessRetry -- No --> Review[Admin reviews]
  Review --> Publish[Publish individual or bulk]
  Publish --> GuestRequest[Guest requests derivative]

  GuestRequest --> GuestAuth[Next.js rechecks gallery and visitor authorization]
  GuestAuth -- Unauthorized --> GuestDeny[Reject]
  GuestAuth -- Authorized and ready --> SignedDelivery[Issue 15-minute signed derivative URL]
  SignedDelivery --> Guest[Guest receives optimized image only]
  GuestAuth -- Missing derivative --> NoUrl[No URL; fail closed]

  Review --> Replace[Admin starts replacement]
  Replace --> NewVersion[Create new versioned R2 keys]
  NewVersion --> ReplaceProcess[Verify and process replacement]
  ReplaceProcess -- Success --> NewActive[New version becomes active/published]
  ReplaceProcess -- Failure --> OldActive[Keep old published version active]
  OldActive --> Retry

  Review --> Trash[Admin soft-deletes photo]
  Trash --> RemoveAccess[Remove guest access immediately]
  RemoveAccess --> RetainTrash[Trash retention: 30 days]
  RetainTrash --> Restore[Master Admin restores]
  RetainTrash --> Permanent[Master Admin permanently deletes]
  Permanent --> DeleteAll[Delete original, derivatives, thumbnails,<br/>processing records]
  DeleteAll --> DeleteRetry[Retry and audit cleanup failures]

